      "body": "Kalpataru Limited has appointed Mr. Gajendra Mewara (ICSI Membership No. A22941) as the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company and designated him as a Key Managerial Personnel (“KMP”) with effect from February 6, 2026. Mr. Gajendra Mewara is a qualified Company Secretary and Law Graduate with over 18 years of extensive experience in corporate secretarial functions, board processes, corporate governance and compliance management across diverse sectors, including healthcare, automobile, infrastructure, insurance, and real estate. He has handled key assignments viz. IPO, QIP, mergers and amalgamations, private equity transactions, setting up compliance management framework and implementation of good corporate governance practices across various organisations. Prior to joining",
